{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_03_end","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_03","title":"早芒种","storyCode":"HS-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"2a0c02a9488ede652a820433bc8a5bf4ca3e17ac106be320e77c7898ca3b2c2f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"左乐逼问绩回到大荒城的目的，绩却表现得无所隐瞒，有恃无恐。另一方面，之前的洪涝灾害似乎在大荒城内引发了一些奇异的现象。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绩先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是......左公子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初次见面，没什么准备，有失礼数了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识我......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诡异的长鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐右手习惯性摸向平时腰间挂刀的位置，却只摸到一个用于操作农耕装置的天师仪。\n这一细小的动作似乎没能逃过男人的眼睛，他嘴角挂上笑意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子不必紧张，只是一些无害的小玩意儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“纺因织果，裁虚为实”......这些东西，是你的造物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"举手之劳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（诡异的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人轻轻挥了挥手，古怪的生物顷刻间化为缕缕细碎的丝线，继而灰飞烟灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们巨兽代理人的能力，始终让人难以琢磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是些雕虫绣花的功夫，能派上用场的地方不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涝灾过后，紧跟着的就是虫害和病害。看不见摸不着的灾害难对付，织成具体物件，再去消灭就容易多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让姐姐看到我做这种事，又要责备我“逆天而行”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本不该出现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里也算是我儿时待过的地方，许多年没有回来过了，有些想念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你们这样的存在，竟然也会有“儿时”这样的概念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论寿命长短，人都有蒙昧无知的时候。那时候见到的新奇事物，印象也会更深一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对一直陪在身边的人，也总会多挂念一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们几位兄弟姐妹的会面是大事，事先都应该通报司岁台才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷补给的车队被天灾拦在了半路上，我收到那位老天师的消息后，可是立刻自掏腰包送了这一批应急的货物来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到这里，我也只是匆匆看了姐姐一眼，那两位妹妹的面都没有见过。司岁台未免有点不近“人”情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生在司岁台的名单里，是需要重点盯防的一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕这些年，我从来没有做过一件违背规矩的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不该由先生说了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可左公子现在，不也没穿着秉烛人的制服？"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的男人笑了笑，温和，礼貌，从容。\n左乐却难自制地感到了一股寒意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实在下久闻左公子玉名。今日终于得以一见，便想或许可以和左公子交个朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用这样客套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些年逗留百灶，见过不少世家子弟。只论文章才学，其中也有不少人堪称青年才俊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但能真正像左公子这样肯踏踏实实做点实事的人，恐怕按学宫的名单挨个数也数不出几位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年十一月，琅珆山海众勾连匪患，左公子孤身涉险，救出了被困匪窝的数十无辜百姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年初二月，为了追查那件特殊的酒盏，路上又是凶险无数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知情的外人只道左公子年纪轻轻身居要职是蒙父辈荫庇，又哪能想到秉烛人的任务有多么凶险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子之前的所有努力，难道因为一次失误就要被全盘否定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些事情......你没有理由知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意人，为了通晓行情，总是习惯多方打听。打听到的东西偶尔也能作为货物售卖。就看客人愿意出多少价钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还要知道，什么样的客人会愿意为什么情报付什么价钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，我还知道大荒城北边的河对岸藏着什么，年在这里造的那件工程到底有什么用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还知道，玉门遭遇天灾一事，你始终怀疑有更高位者从中做梗，但迟迟抓不住线索，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然知道先生行事周密，滴水不漏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可司岁台也绝非无能之辈，但凡有任何蛛丝马迹，司岁台都会一查到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下敬告先生，不要做逾矩之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是左公子作为朋友的提醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我作为司岁台秉烛人的忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想左公子应该是多虑了......整个炎国最精锐的天师尽数留守在大荒城北边的天机阁里，我一个人又能掀起什么风浪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起在下，此时此刻，还是这条河对岸的那些邪祟诡魔，更该让人担心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子大概还不知道，最近三个月以来，天机阁已经死了多少天师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休要蛊惑人心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意人诚信为本，我从来不说假话。左公子要是不信，不如自己先去查查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再好好想一想，自己想要做什么。要不要也来找我做一笔交易。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都和往常一样。\n风声静悄悄的。\n牧兽低下头去吃草。\n女孩环顾四周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绵绵也是个笨牧兽，每次都跟他说不许乱跑，就是记不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾也是个笨牧兽......吹过的曲子都记不住，笨死了！再也不和他玩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"宽大的叶片层层叠叠，密得几乎看不到天，风送来稻子的清香。\n土地潮湿，女孩向前深一脚浅一脚地踩在地上，拨开遮挡住天空的叶片，往前走着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绵绵——回家啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绵绵！你怎么又在乱跑？快回棚里去，不然我也要挨批评了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"微风轻拂，牧兽的眼睛水汪汪的，宽大的瞳孔乌黑乌黑，映出天空、云彩、稻田。\n小满在牧兽眼中看到了自己的倒影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再吃草了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是......小禾最近又做出来什么奇奇怪怪的饲料了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去和他说说，马上就给你们改善伙食！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，很可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下来，会死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不要和我们一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说前几天的洪水吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕，洪水都已经过去了，我可以给你们造更坚固的房子，再大的天灾来了你们都不用怕，我会保护好你们的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个东西是从河对岸来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧兽的声音","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你脚下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的脚下......怎么了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满在牧兽眼中看到了自己的倒影。\n微风轻拂，牧兽的眼睛水汪汪的，宽大的瞳孔乌黑乌黑，映出天空、云彩、稻田。\n女孩环顾四周。\n牧兽低下头去吃草。\n风声静悄悄的。\n一切都和往常一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g7_fieldhouse"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯，您这是在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搬树。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搬树？这桃树在这里长得好好的，您怎么突然要搬它？之前那些土木天师们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搭把手，把这些土堆到旁边去......那些人已经回工厂里，过一会儿就开着车过来运材料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大伙都知道了，这些地是保不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，你平时和大伙都熟，又是天师府的学生，你能不能给我们句准话，这片地到底出了什么问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，大人物眼里这一亩三分地都是生意，改成移动地块要花多少钱，又能赚多少钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这是我们的家！我们祖祖辈辈都住在这！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"张口闭口就是让我们不要这种了这么多年的地方，咋可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是......我的家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯，我保证，我一定会搞清楚这里发生了什么问题，我会想办法，保下这些地的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子的保证管什么用，他们之前要建移动城市的时候，还保证会搬走这些田呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，算了。地轧了就轧了，我权当被天灾给砸了，这树我必须挖走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这树是我爷爷的奶奶种在这里的......住在移动城市里的人觉得“家”是可以搬走的，那这棵树就是我的家，我也要把它搬走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮您......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老农将桃树扛上肩头，脚印一步步陷入土中，他背着自己的故乡。\n禾生托着这沉甸甸的桃树，他回头看向核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"樵夫的眼睛向下看着，有些无神。\n他沉默了又沉默，最终还是开了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，原来您会说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到这里来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我养的牧兽丢了，我刚看到他了，我来找他回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里有牧兽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩伸出手，指向身旁。\n脚下的水面倒映出她的身影，倒映出云彩、天空。\n秸秆密密麻麻，却没有半点动物的足迹。\n女孩用力眨了眨眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚刚明明在这的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我带你去找牧兽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子请坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宁侍郎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到这么碰巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从尚蜀到玉门，再到这大荒城，左公子作为秉烛人一定是表现卓越，才会如此受重用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁侍郎有什么指教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岂敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是官身相见，我就不会在这种地方约见左公子了......有一件事，只能用这种形式委托左公子帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是关于岁兽代理人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十二楼五城的建设是大炎至关重要的工程，在这个时刻一座城里聚集了四位代理人，实在是件棘手的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人想要借机生事，后果不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁侍郎的意思是，已经知道有人想要借机生事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城建设工程重新启动的事，左公子听说了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个商人的补给物资......他不该去干涉这些事务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，他回来以后，与工部的万侍郎见过一回——左公子对这位大人是否有印象？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得......这些年他一直在负责大荒城的移动地块建设，但是数月前，他还分出功夫去处理了玉门城的修复工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绩，他究竟想做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据记载，绩、黍二人交好，千年前，二人一同在大荒城耕作。但是不久后，他便离开了大荒城，开始经营生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他每隔数十年，都会回到大荒城一次，而他上一次回来已经是六十年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁侍郎对于这些记载倒是记得很清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怀疑他想对大荒城不利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要先查明他当下返回大荒城的目的——这正是我想委托左公子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼部与司岁台在处理岁兽问题上向来不合，现在宁侍郎要我来做这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那左公子自己，是什么立场呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为秉烛人，当然是奉命行事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子是专心想当一把好刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那即便砍错了目标，责任也不在刀上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有想过推诿责任——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那左公子可曾想过，司岁台究竟为何力主以强硬手段除“岁”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有朝一日，玉门开赴京城，两座城市与巨兽都在炮火声中灰飞烟灭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些流离失所的百姓，战死的将士，难道真的只用一句“别无选择”来带过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道真的没有别的手段来解决问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那宁小姐是出于什么立场让我做这件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并非官场龃龉，只是为社稷百姓，谋一份利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“光明磊落”，左公子心里应该会有一个答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人用手指了指静谧的河流，水面平如镜，让人恍然间觉得河水变得凝固。\n水面反射着天上的云彩，反射出女孩的脸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧兽，在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在河里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找，去下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我下去了就能看到牧兽了，我要把他带回棚子里去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"河道中传来轰鸣的水声，空气汹涌地流动着。\n女孩向前踏出了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g13_pollutedfield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来！你会死的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"双眼有些失神的老樵夫突然高高举起了手中的斧头，又无力地垂了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲恸的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖师，让我去吧！让我去救她回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲恸的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道要怎么对付那个东西，她陷得还不深，您让我去，我能救回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲恸的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖师！别！她还有救！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲恸的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖师——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离那里太近就是送死，她没救了，你救不回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带回去吧，回去立一块碑吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呆子！你要到哪去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......牧兽在下面，大叔指给我看了，我要去把他带回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你像头牧兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你骂我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我骂的就是你！你眼睛瞎了牧兽才会在下面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大嗓门你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啪！\n一大团泥直接砸向了小满的头，从河堤随手抓来的淤泥糊了她满脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗噗噗！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"视线却并未像想象中那般受阻，她仍然能够看到眼前的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满胡乱地想从脸上把泥抹下来，湿软的泥里却有两颗坚硬的东西，正吸在她的脸上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我脸上为什么有两粒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稻子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哑巴大叔人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有什么大叔？老远就看到你顶着两个豆豆眼就准备往水里蹿，你失心疯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧把它扔了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满就着河水冲洗干净脸上的淤泥。\n骂骂咧咧的孩童回过头，堰口后的树林中空无一人。但她还是冲着树林深深地望了一眼，点了点头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"窸窸窣窣的脚步声渐渐远去，回到了树林深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"擅入大荒城，私会代理人，有违禁律。念其赈灾有功，暂不问罪。\n勒令其三日内于司岁台监管下离开大荒城，如有延误，从严处置。\n盖着朱红印章的信函静静放在桌上最显眼的位置，就像知道房屋主人什么时候会回来，会以怎样的心情看到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不愿意当面和我说吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是信我，可到头来，我们还有坐下来好好聊聊的机会吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
